      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحزّبوا</span></b>  <i>They became</i> [or <i>formed themselves
into</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْزَاب</span>, (A, Msb, K,) i. e. <i>parties, classes,
bodies, divisions,</i> or <i>the like;</i> (A;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حازبوا</span></b> :
(K:) <i>they collected themselves together,</i> (S, Mgh, *
TA,) against (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى</span>) others. (Mgh.)

